[[:db/add "e54193fa-674b-57bd-b84b-d76431906b6d" :answer/id #uuid "e54193fa-674b-57bd-b84b-d76431906b6d"] [:db/add "e54193fa-674b-57bd-b84b-d76431906b6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e54193fa-674b-57bd-b84b-d76431906b6d" :answer/value "{59}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "e54193fa-674b-57bd-b84b-d76431906b6d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3f3555e7-76cc-58b7-b084-57a457f82ac7" :answer/id #uuid "3f3555e7-76cc-58b7-b084-57a457f82ac7"] [:db/add "3f3555e7-76cc-58b7-b084-57a457f82ac7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3f3555e7-76cc-58b7-b084-57a457f82ac7" :answer/value "{55}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "3f3555e7-76cc-58b7-b084-57a457f82ac7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d337d87b-784c-5884-85d9-dde8eef8b832" :answer/id #uuid "d337d87b-784c-5884-85d9-dde8eef8b832"] [:db/add "d337d87b-784c-5884-85d9-dde8eef8b832" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d337d87b-784c-5884-85d9-dde8eef8b832" :answer/value "{61}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "d337d87b-784c-5884-85d9-dde8eef8b832" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e2e45505-5515-5a20-97a9-f1eaa6ec8d40" :answer/id #uuid "e2e45505-5515-5a20-97a9-f1eaa6ec8d40"] [:db/add "e2e45505-5515-5a20-97a9-f1eaa6ec8d40" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e2e45505-5515-5a20-97a9-f1eaa6ec8d40" :answer/value "{53}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "e2e45505-5515-5a20-97a9-f1eaa6ec8d40" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0496ce21-94ad-5059-9245-6e93db58d821" :answer/id #uuid "0496ce21-94ad-5059-9245-6e93db58d821"] [:db/add "0496ce21-94ad-5059-9245-6e93db58d821" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0496ce21-94ad-5059-9245-6e93db58d821" :answer/value "{58}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "0496ce21-94ad-5059-9245-6e93db58d821" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4" :answer-field/id #uuid "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4"] [:db/add "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4" :answer-field/choices "e54193fa-674b-57bd-b84b-d76431906b6d"] [:db/add "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4" :answer-field/choices "3f3555e7-76cc-58b7-b084-57a457f82ac7"] [:db/add "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4" :answer-field/choices "d337d87b-784c-5884-85d9-dde8eef8b832"] [:db/add "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4" :answer-field/choices "e2e45505-5515-5a20-97a9-f1eaa6ec8d40"] [:db/add "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4" :answer-field/choices "0496ce21-94ad-5059-9245-6e93db58d821"] [:db/add "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4" :answer-field/correct "3f3555e7-76cc-58b7-b084-57a457f82ac7"] [:db/ensure "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5a5a1d59-ffa3-514b-bca9-b5126ed8e4bf" :question/id #uuid "5a5a1d59-ffa3-514b-bca9-b5126ed8e4bf"] [:db/add "5a5a1d59-ffa3-514b-bca9-b5126ed8e4bf" :question/problem "The temperature $T(t),$ in degrees Celsius, of a compressor of a refrigerator can be modeled by the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{dT}{dt}=-0.09(T-34)\n$$\n\nwhere $t>0$ is the time, measured in minutes. If the initial temperature of the compressor is ${96}^{∘}C,$ calculate the temperature of the compressor after $12$ minutes. Round your answer to the nearest integer."] [:db/add "5a5a1d59-ffa3-514b-bca9-b5126ed8e4bf" :question/worked-solution "We're told that the temperature of the compressor of a refrigerator is modeled by the inhibited decay equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{dT}{dt}=-0.09(T-34).\n$$\n\nFirst, we integrate our differential equation by separating the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dT}{T-34} & =-0.09\\,dt \\\\ \\int \\frac{dT}{T-34} & =-\\int 0.09\\,\\text{d}t \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|T-34| & =-0.09t+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince this is the solution to an inhibited decay equation, we have $T-34>0$ for all $t>0.$\nNext, we solve for $T(t),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T-34 & ={e}^{-0.09t+C} \\\\ T-34 & ={e}^{C}{e}^{-0.09t} \\\\ T-34 & =K{e}^{-0.09t} \\\\ T & =34+K{e}^{-0.09t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that $K={e}^{C}$ is a constant of integration. \n\nWe're told that the initial temperature of the compressor was ${96}^{∘}C.$ So, we apply the initial condition $T(0)=96,$ and solve for $K:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}96 & =34+K{e}^{0} \\\\ 96 & =34+K \\\\ K & =62\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to our initial value problem is\n\n$$\nT(t)=34+62{e}^{-0.09t}.\n$$\n\nFinally, the temperature of the compressor after $t=12$ minutes is\n\n$$\nT(12)=34+62{e}^{-0.09\\cdot 12}≈{55}^{∘}\\text{C},\n$$\n\nrounded to the nearest integer."] [:db/add "5a5a1d59-ffa3-514b-bca9-b5126ed8e4bf" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "5a5a1d59-ffa3-514b-bca9-b5126ed8e4bf" :question/answer-fields "9b78b1b8-fbe7-50fe-a450-31525c7b8ea4"] [:db/ensure "5a5a1d59-ffa3-514b-bca9-b5126ed8e4bf" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186078584 :knowledge-point/questions "5a5a1d59-ffa3-514b-bca9-b5126ed8e4bf"] [:db/add "6f49ad19-3571-500e-bae9-8b2b72dc7975" :answer/id #uuid "6f49ad19-3571-500e-bae9-8b2b72dc7975"] [:db/add "6f49ad19-3571-500e-bae9-8b2b72dc7975" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6f49ad19-3571-500e-bae9-8b2b72dc7975" :answer/value "{53}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "6f49ad19-3571-500e-bae9-8b2b72dc7975" :answer/validate] [:db/add "535f5b1f-e65c-5148-9576-c6d54a0f7ee7" :answer/id #uuid "535f5b1f-e65c-5148-9576-c6d54a0f7ee7"] [:db/add "535f5b1f-e65c-5148-9576-c6d54a0f7ee7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "535f5b1f-e65c-5148-9576-c6d54a0f7ee7" :answer/value "{56}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "535f5b1f-e65c-5148-9576-c6d54a0f7ee7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f6ddc331-dc9a-5453-bcbd-7038f002203f" :answer/id #uuid "f6ddc331-dc9a-5453-bcbd-7038f002203f"] [:db/add "f6ddc331-dc9a-5453-bcbd-7038f002203f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f6ddc331-dc9a-5453-bcbd-7038f002203f" :answer/value "{52}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "f6ddc331-dc9a-5453-bcbd-7038f002203f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "13855e76-e295-5d9a-8d11-1c293c24822e" :answer/id #uuid "13855e76-e295-5d9a-8d11-1c293c24822e"] [:db/add "13855e76-e295-5d9a-8d11-1c293c24822e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "13855e76-e295-5d9a-8d11-1c293c24822e" :answer/value "{57}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "13855e76-e295-5d9a-8d11-1c293c24822e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7a2ff935-e641-5936-a4ec-1a5e21cee286" :answer/id #uuid "7a2ff935-e641-5936-a4ec-1a5e21cee286"] [:db/add "7a2ff935-e641-5936-a4ec-1a5e21cee286" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7a2ff935-e641-5936-a4ec-1a5e21cee286" :answer/value "{58}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "7a2ff935-e641-5936-a4ec-1a5e21cee286" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d" :answer-field/id #uuid "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d"] [:db/add "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d" :answer-field/choices "6f49ad19-3571-500e-bae9-8b2b72dc7975"] [:db/add "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d" :answer-field/choices "535f5b1f-e65c-5148-9576-c6d54a0f7ee7"] [:db/add "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d" :answer-field/choices "f6ddc331-dc9a-5453-bcbd-7038f002203f"] [:db/add "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d" :answer-field/choices "13855e76-e295-5d9a-8d11-1c293c24822e"] [:db/add "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d" :answer-field/choices "7a2ff935-e641-5936-a4ec-1a5e21cee286"] [:db/add "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d" :answer-field/correct "6f49ad19-3571-500e-bae9-8b2b72dc7975"] [:db/ensure "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "980a5957-ed65-5e73-85e5-566f07d47b61" :question/id #uuid "980a5957-ed65-5e73-85e5-566f07d47b61"] [:db/add "980a5957-ed65-5e73-85e5-566f07d47b61" :question/problem "The temperature $T(t),$ in degrees Celsius, of a fluorescent light bulb after turning off can be modeled by the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{dT}{dt}=-0.07(T-34)\n$$\n\nwhere $t>0$ is the time, measured in minutes. If the initial temperature of the bulb is ${65}^{∘}C,$ calculate the temperature of the bulb after $7$ minutes. Round your answer to the nearest integer."] [:db/add "980a5957-ed65-5e73-85e5-566f07d47b61" :question/worked-solution "We're told that the temperature of the fluorescent light bulb is modeled by the inhibited decay equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{dT}{dt}=-0.07(T-34).\n$$\n\nFirst, we integrate our differential equation by separating the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dT}{T-34} & =-0.07\\,dt \\\\ \\int \\frac{dT}{T-34} & =-\\int 0.07\\,\\text{d}t \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|T-34| & =-0.07t+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince this is the solution to an inhibited decay equation, we have $T-34>0$ for all $t>0.$\nNext, we solve for $T(t),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T-34 & ={e}^{-0.07t+C} \\\\ T-34 & ={e}^{C}{e}^{-0.07t} \\\\ T-34 & =K{e}^{-0.07t} \\\\ T & =34+K{e}^{-0.07t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that $K={e}^{C}$ is a constant of integration. \n\nWe're told that the initial temperature of the bulb was ${65}^{∘}C.$ So, we apply the initial condition $T(0)=65,$ and solve for $K:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}65 & =34+K{e}^{0} \\\\ 65 & =34+K \\\\ K & =31\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to our initial value problem is\n\n$$\nT(t)=34+31{e}^{-0.07t}.\n$$\n\nFinally, the temperature of the bulb after $t=7$ minutes is\n\n$$\nT(7)=34+31{e}^{-0.07\\cdot 7}≈{53}^{∘}\\text{C},\n$$\n\nrounded to the nearest integer."] [:db/add "980a5957-ed65-5e73-85e5-566f07d47b61" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "980a5957-ed65-5e73-85e5-566f07d47b61" :question/answer-fields "d6b2f37f-52a6-5af2-a3b8-26d28c39951d"] [:db/ensure "980a5957-ed65-5e73-85e5-566f07d47b61" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186078584 :knowledge-point/questions "980a5957-ed65-5e73-85e5-566f07d47b61"] [:db/add "708c015e-8ffa-5dd3-8bdf-3b6335424caf" :answer/id #uuid "708c015e-8ffa-5dd3-8bdf-3b6335424caf"] [:db/add "708c015e-8ffa-5dd3-8bdf-3b6335424caf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "708c015e-8ffa-5dd3-8bdf-3b6335424caf" :answer/value "{111}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "708c015e-8ffa-5dd3-8bdf-3b6335424caf" :answer/validate] [:db/add "96a3750a-e8ce-5fd8-a114-550474ae2c1e" :answer/id #uuid "96a3750a-e8ce-5fd8-a114-550474ae2c1e"] [:db/add "96a3750a-e8ce-5fd8-a114-550474ae2c1e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "96a3750a-e8ce-5fd8-a114-550474ae2c1e" :answer/value "{113}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "96a3750a-e8ce-5fd8-a114-550474ae2c1e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "14ca0aad-76fb-51da-8fca-64986833086a" :answer/id #uuid "14ca0aad-76fb-51da-8fca-64986833086a"] [:db/add "14ca0aad-76fb-51da-8fca-64986833086a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "14ca0aad-76fb-51da-8fca-64986833086a" :answer/value "{109}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "14ca0aad-76fb-51da-8fca-64986833086a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0be068eb-64c8-59a3-afa7-5664f17d1b0c" :answer/id #uuid "0be068eb-64c8-59a3-afa7-5664f17d1b0c"] [:db/add "0be068eb-64c8-59a3-afa7-5664f17d1b0c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0be068eb-64c8-59a3-afa7-5664f17d1b0c" :answer/value "{115}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "0be068eb-64c8-59a3-afa7-5664f17d1b0c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6163c0dc-e2e5-5bc5-822c-c053738923b6" :answer/id #uuid "6163c0dc-e2e5-5bc5-822c-c053738923b6"] [:db/add "6163c0dc-e2e5-5bc5-822c-c053738923b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6163c0dc-e2e5-5bc5-822c-c053738923b6" :answer/value "{116}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "6163c0dc-e2e5-5bc5-822c-c053738923b6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036" :answer-field/id #uuid "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036"] [:db/add "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036" :answer-field/choices "708c015e-8ffa-5dd3-8bdf-3b6335424caf"] [:db/add "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036" :answer-field/choices "96a3750a-e8ce-5fd8-a114-550474ae2c1e"] [:db/add "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036" :answer-field/choices "14ca0aad-76fb-51da-8fca-64986833086a"] [:db/add "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036" :answer-field/choices "0be068eb-64c8-59a3-afa7-5664f17d1b0c"] [:db/add "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036" :answer-field/choices "6163c0dc-e2e5-5bc5-822c-c053738923b6"] [:db/add "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036" :answer-field/correct "14ca0aad-76fb-51da-8fca-64986833086a"] [:db/ensure "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0bcfe524-d1bc-5602-9bbb-6250eda84ba0" :question/id #uuid "0bcfe524-d1bc-5602-9bbb-6250eda84ba0"] [:db/add "0bcfe524-d1bc-5602-9bbb-6250eda84ba0" :question/problem "The temperature $T(t),$ in degrees Celsius, of a cooling iron can be modeled by the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{dT}{dt}=-0.03(T-30)\n$$\n\nwhere $t>0$ is the time, measured in minutes. If the initial temperature of the iron is ${119}^{∘}C,$ calculate its temperature after $4$ minutes. Round your answer to the nearest integer."] [:db/add "0bcfe524-d1bc-5602-9bbb-6250eda84ba0" :question/worked-solution "We're told that the temperature of the cooling iron is modeled by the inhibited decay equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{dT}{dt}=-0.03(T-30).\n$$\n\nFirst, we integrate our differential equation by separating the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dT}{T-30} & =-0.03\\,dt \\\\ \\int \\frac{dT}{T-30} & =-\\int 0.03\\,\\text{d}t \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|T-30| & =-0.03t+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince this is the solution to an inhibited decay equation, we have $T-30>0$ for all $t>0.$\nNext, we solve for $T(t),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T-30 & ={e}^{-0.03t+C} \\\\ T-30 & ={e}^{C}{e}^{-0.03t} \\\\ T-30 & =K{e}^{-0.03t} \\\\ T & =30+K{e}^{-0.03t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that $K={e}^{C}$ is a constant of integration. \n\nWe're told that the initial temperature of the iron was ${119}^{∘}C.$ So, we apply the initial condition $T(0)=119,$ and solve for $K:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}119 & =30+K{e}^{0} \\\\ 119 & =30+K \\\\ K & =89\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to our initial value problem is\n\n$$\nT(t)=30+89{e}^{-0.03t}.\n$$\n\nFinally, the temperature of the iron after $t=4$ minutes is\n\n$$\nT(4)=30+89{e}^{-0.03\\cdot 4}≈{109}^{∘}\\text{C},\n$$\n\nrounded to the nearest integer."] [:db/add "0bcfe524-d1bc-5602-9bbb-6250eda84ba0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "0bcfe524-d1bc-5602-9bbb-6250eda84ba0" :question/answer-fields "0cd6a476-2f32-513b-b9d7-56d18d395036"] [:db/ensure "0bcfe524-d1bc-5602-9bbb-6250eda84ba0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186078584 :knowledge-point/questions "0bcfe524-d1bc-5602-9bbb-6250eda84ba0"] [:db/add "81e12548-0078-542b-a7be-ebccf5ee0831" :answer/id #uuid "81e12548-0078-542b-a7be-ebccf5ee0831"] [:db/add "81e12548-0078-542b-a7be-ebccf5ee0831" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "81e12548-0078-542b-a7be-ebccf5ee0831" :answer/value "{42}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "81e12548-0078-542b-a7be-ebccf5ee0831" :answer/validate] [:db/add "69df54c2-ee15-5a9b-a0b9-ba288365db68" :answer/id #uuid "69df54c2-ee15-5a9b-a0b9-ba288365db68"] [:db/add "69df54c2-ee15-5a9b-a0b9-ba288365db68" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "69df54c2-ee15-5a9b-a0b9-ba288365db68" :answer/value "{43}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "69df54c2-ee15-5a9b-a0b9-ba288365db68" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2c113558-955c-5204-a915-d21433372a41" :answer/id #uuid "2c113558-955c-5204-a915-d21433372a41"] [:db/add "2c113558-955c-5204-a915-d21433372a41" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2c113558-955c-5204-a915-d21433372a41" :answer/value "{44}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "2c113558-955c-5204-a915-d21433372a41" :answer/validate] [:db/add "34e055a3-ef9f-5de7-b337-ea388b3368b5" :answer/id #uuid "34e055a3-ef9f-5de7-b337-ea388b3368b5"] [:db/add "34e055a3-ef9f-5de7-b337-ea388b3368b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "34e055a3-ef9f-5de7-b337-ea388b3368b5" :answer/value "{39}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "34e055a3-ef9f-5de7-b337-ea388b3368b5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "59d7abd4-e8b4-5fb6-9c0e-a26d63d65981" :answer/id #uuid "59d7abd4-e8b4-5fb6-9c0e-a26d63d65981"] [:db/add "59d7abd4-e8b4-5fb6-9c0e-a26d63d65981" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "59d7abd4-e8b4-5fb6-9c0e-a26d63d65981" :answer/value "{40}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "59d7abd4-e8b4-5fb6-9c0e-a26d63d65981" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2" :answer-field/id #uuid "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2"] [:db/add "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2" :answer-field/choices "81e12548-0078-542b-a7be-ebccf5ee0831"] [:db/add "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2" :answer-field/choices "69df54c2-ee15-5a9b-a0b9-ba288365db68"] [:db/add "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2" :answer-field/choices "2c113558-955c-5204-a915-d21433372a41"] [:db/add "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2" :answer-field/choices "34e055a3-ef9f-5de7-b337-ea388b3368b5"] [:db/add "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2" :answer-field/choices "59d7abd4-e8b4-5fb6-9c0e-a26d63d65981"] [:db/add "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2" :answer-field/correct "2c113558-955c-5204-a915-d21433372a41"] [:db/ensure "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "20cf5dff-13d7-53c1-80a8-f2d47d353696" :question/id #uuid "20cf5dff-13d7-53c1-80a8-f2d47d353696"] [:db/add "20cf5dff-13d7-53c1-80a8-f2d47d353696" :question/problem "The temperature $T(t),$ in degrees Celsius, of a body can be modeled by the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{dT}{dt}=-0.08(T-33)\n$$\n\nwhere $t>0$ is the time, measured in minutes. If the initial temperature of the body is ${55}^{∘}C,$ calculate the temperature of the body after $9$ minutes. Round your answer to the nearest integer."] [:db/add "20cf5dff-13d7-53c1-80a8-f2d47d353696" :question/worked-solution "We're told that the temperature of the body is modeled by the inhibited decay equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{dT}{dt}=-0.08(T-33).\n$$\n\nFirst, we integrate our differential equation by separating the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dT}{T-33} & =-0.08\\,dt \\\\ \\int \\frac{dT}{T-33} & =-\\int 0.08\\,\\text{d}t \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|T-33| & =-0.08t+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince this is the solution to an inhibited decay equation, we have $T-33>0$ for all $t>0.$\nNext, we solve for $T(t),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T-33 & ={e}^{-0.08t+C} \\\\ T-33 & ={e}^{C}{e}^{-0.08t} \\\\ T-33 & =K{e}^{-0.08t} \\\\ T & =33+K{e}^{-0.08t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that $K={e}^{C}$ is a constant of integration. \n\nWe're told that the initial temperature of the body was ${55}^{∘}C.$ So, we apply the initial condition $T(0)=55,$ and solve for $K:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}55 & =33+K{e}^{0} \\\\ 55 & =33+K \\\\ K & =22\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to our initial value problem is\n\n$$\nT(t)=33+22{e}^{-0.08t}.\n$$\n\nFinally, the temperature of the body after $t=9$ minutes is\n\n$$\nT(9)=33+22{e}^{-0.08\\cdot 9}≈{44}^{∘}\\text{C},\n$$\n\nrounded to the nearest integer."] [:db/add "20cf5dff-13d7-53c1-80a8-f2d47d353696" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "20cf5dff-13d7-53c1-80a8-f2d47d353696" :question/answer-fields "d517d6ae-4a01-559e-a78d-ff71eb2425d2"] [:db/ensure "20cf5dff-13d7-53c1-80a8-f2d47d353696" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186078584 :knowledge-point/questions "20cf5dff-13d7-53c1-80a8-f2d47d353696"] [:db/add "9363bab4-0b88-5da7-9187-b6087fb174fd" :answer/id #uuid "9363bab4-0b88-5da7-9187-b6087fb174fd"] [:db/add "9363bab4-0b88-5da7-9187-b6087fb174fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9363bab4-0b88-5da7-9187-b6087fb174fd" :answer/value "{80}^{∘}\\text{C}"] [:db/ensure "9363bab4-0b88-5da7-9187-b6087fb174fd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "78871fa2-3d48-5d31-a760-6b331565db36" :answer/id #uuid "78871fa2-3d48-5d31-